  "name": "BenchUp (ex-KetchUp3D) — open-source 3D woodworking & furniture modeler",
  "summary": "Free, open-source SketchUp-style modeler for woodworking, written in Rust (wgpu/WebGPU), running in the browser or as a native Windows/macOS/Linux app. Push/Pull, components, tags, dimensions, wood joinery (mortise-tenon, dovetail, finger...), grain direction, cut lists and cutting-plan PDF export; imports .skp, exports .obj. No account needed.",
